	"Description": "All mods are for latest SMAPI and SDV as of time of release. [size=1]These mods will probably not receive any updates.[/size]\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Crudberries[/size][/b]\n<br />These berries grow like cranberries but year-round, will cost you money to sell, hurt to eat, and are only available before year 3. You can even make dishes with them!\n<br />\n<br />Everyone hates them.\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Rock in Your Shoe[/size][/b]\n<br />There's a rock in your shoe. Yes, only one of them.\n<br />\n<br />If you have boots equipped, there's a chance you'll take damage every other footstep. Better boots have a higher chance (because more defense = more uncomfortable and rigid, right?)\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Weeds Honey[/size][/b]\n<br />Nobody can escape the Weeds Honey.\n<br />\n<br />If any weeds are near a bee hive, you'll get Weeds Honey instead of other honey.\n<br />\n<br />[b][size=5]Trigger Action Action Code[/size][/b]\n<br />Run C# code in your trigger actions! Can support inline code, or embedded files in your mod. It works similarly to Console Code.\n<br />\n<br />Syntax:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][font=Courier New]cs &lt;c# code here&gt;[/font][/*]\n<br />[*][font=Courier New]cs --script MyModId/MyCode.cs[/font][/*]\n<br />[*][font=Courier New]cs --script MyModId/MyOtherCode.cs arg1 arg2 arg3...[/font][/*]\n<br />[/list]\n<br />Please don't use this.\n<br />\n<br />(NOTE: This last mod is no longer available.)",
